= Programming
[../../../blog.html ← Blogs]

Study guides for programming in quantitative research, from language fundamentals to numerical computing, data analysis, and modeling. Each guide is available in Chinese and English.

- *Python Fundamentals* — objects, data structures, functions, and the standard library. [python-for-quant-interviews.html 中文] \M [python-for-quant-interviews-en.html English]
- *Numerical Computing* — arrays and vectorized computation with NumPy. [numpy-for-quant-interviews.html 中文] \M [numpy-for-quant-interviews-en.html English]
- *Data Analysis* — tabular data and time series with pandas. [pandas-for-quant-interviews.html 中文] \M [pandas-for-quant-interviews-en.html English]
- *Machine Learning* — model fitting and evaluation with scikit-learn. [scikit-learn-for-quant-interviews.html 中文] \M [scikit-learn-for-quant-interviews-en.html English]
